2, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011aU6EF2LjZrf2imVDF9oBy", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 9814, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Q7nobAXtMbmrTTSrsf7E7h", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10114, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Q7nobAXtMbmrTTSrsf7E7h", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10114, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Q7nobAXtMbmrTTSrsf7E7h", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 10114, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01P4Ao695uXErvEyTM62RtPf", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate was 0.18 across us-east, us-west, and eu-west). Per the runbook, I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, but only in staging. Next steps: confirm error rate recovery on v2.3.0, investigate the v2.3.1 failure before any re-release, and determine whether a change-manager review is needed for v2.3.1.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10714, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01P4Ao695uXErvEyTM62RtPf", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10714, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01P4Ao695uXErvEyTM62RtPf", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12175, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and it is healthy again. Error rate dropped from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy, but it only ran in staging.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the rollback, and the regions affected, and it paged the on-call engineer.\n\nThe incident lists follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure before any re-release, and confirm whether v2.3.1 needs change-manager review before it ships again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the release history and current status for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_012b72XKsvyruvzsMs1Rb7ks", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01St38dSRVKd9sD3gWGWZcBF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011aU6EF2LjZrf2imVDF9oBy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "ver